OL,3,GNEWSAMan in his 30s dies after Dublin
OL,4,Aassault
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man has died after a "fatal assault"
OL,7,Fin Dublin, gardai (Irish police) have
OL,8,Fsaid.
OL,10,FHe has been named locally as Jamie
OL,11,FBailey who was in his late 30s.
OL,13,FHe was found with serious injuries on a
OL,14,Ffootpath at Blackhorse Place in the
OL,15,Fearly hours of Sunday and was brought
OL,16,Fto hospital where he was pronounced
OL,17,Fdead.
OL,19,FThe scene of the assault has been
OL,20,Fcordoned off for forensic examination.
OL,23,APub: 18-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
